<http://www.spektrix.com/nacc/event/31001ANSGMCKVDLMTPSRQHVNSMPTMDPCG> a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Lumber";
  schema:description """
	All at once, Jack Bennet got dumped, fired, and evicted, and, worst of all, his beloved dog died. All he’s got now is a truck and a chainsaw. He decides to leave Alberta and flee north, really far north, into the Yukon. There he finds a new purpose in starting his own wood harvesting business. Join Jack around the fire as he tells his story of finding community in unlikely places and connecting with his home and heritage in an unconventional way.
""";
