<http://www.spektrix.com/nacc/event/35401APNVLPNRJRDCGRRCTSSJTSMNRNQD> a schema:Event;
  schema:name "Magic is Funny with Wes Barker";
  schema:description """
	Wes Barker is the most famous magician who will still answer your DMs. He is a Winner on the hit show Penn & Teller: Fool US, and star of Big Trick Energy on truTV. Wes has over a billion views online and numerous TV appearances that include Ellen, America’s Got Talent, MTV, Kill Tony, and Wizard Wars. Wes has a style of comedy magic that is uniquely his own. He will have you laughing at hilarious true stories one moment and be blowing your mind the next. Watching Wes is guaranteed to be a wild ride of laughter and amazement from a magician at the top of his game. 
""";
